<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Kalon raised at BZW.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Kalon raised at BZW.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kalon Plc, a maker of paints and building chemicals, was raised to a &quot;buy&quot; from a &quot;hold&quot; at BZW, market sources said on Wednesday, following a French court approval for a planned reorganisation of its French operations.</p>
<p>The brokerage raised its 1997 pre-tax profit estimate to 45 million stg from 42 million, saying it expected the company to be able to achieve cost savings of some 10 million stg in the medium term as a result of the French court ruling, sources said. Analysts at BZW were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>The stock was unchanged at 117p.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
